==
	 UserDetailsService is a contract between out application and spring security
	through which spring security knows how to obtain user details

	spring security starts in a web application from filters

	whenever the request enters the filter chain
		the authentication filter deligates to authentication manager
		the authentication manager is an object whose purpose is to find a way
			in which it can authenticate the users
			which is implemented by objectes called authentication providers

		we do have only one authentication manager
		but we can have one or more authentication providers
		although we have only one authentication provider

	if the authenticatin provider uses the username and password credentials
		then it has to use two components namely
			UserDetailsService and PasswordEncoder

	if the authentication succeeds
		the last thing that happens, it stores the authentication object in a security context

