	Granted Authorities
	````````````````````
	User -> Granted Authorities(Interface)
			|
		`````````````````
		|		|
	Authorities	      Role
	
	behind the scene, the interface Granted Authorities, we use to implement authorities or role
	there is nothing special about using Role or Authorities
	it's the same contract and Granted Aurhtorities represent both of them
	
	from conceptual perspective-- authority is an actiion
		an action that a user can do in an applicatoin
		it is usually represented by a verb like read write delete execute
	role is like a badge like admin manager user visitor etc.

	It all depends on how we want to implement rules or authority restriction in our application

	if we want to have authorization configuraton based on action, i.e., we want granular control
		then we use authorities

	technically it's all one contract behind the role be it authorities or role

		
